\[ \begin{aligned} \mathbf w_0&amp;=\boldsymbol\alpha\\ \mathbf k_1&amp;=h\,\mathbf f(t_j,\mathbf w_j)\\ \mathbf k_2&amp;=h\,\mathbf f\!\left(t_j+\tfrac h2,\ \mathbf w_j+\tfrac12\mathbf k_1\right)\\ \mathbf k_3&amp;=h\,\mathbf f\!\left(t_j+\tfrac h2,\ \mathbf w_j+\tfrac12\mathbf k_2\right)\\ \mathbf k_4&amp;=h\,\mathbf f\!\left(t_j+h,\ \mathbf w_j+\mathbf k_3\right)\\ \mathbf w_{j+1}&amp;=\mathbf w_j+\tfrac16\left(\mathbf k_1+2\mathbf k_2+2\mathbf k_3+\mathbf k_4\right) \end{aligned} \] <p>标量形式的每个方程独立执行同一套公式，只是第 \(i\) 个分量用 \(f_i\) 且其余分量同时参与：</p> \[ k_{1,i}=hf_i(t_j,w_{1,j},\dots,w_{m,j}),\quad k_{2,i}=hf_i\!\left(t_j+\tfrac h2,\ w_{1,j}+\tfrac12 k_{1,1},\ \dots,\ w_{m,j}+\tfrac12 k_{1,m}\right),\ \dots \] <pre><code>function [t, W] = rk4sys(f, a, b, alpha, N)
% RK4 求解一阶方程组 u' = f(t,u)，u(a)=alpha
h = (b - a) / N;  t = (a:h:b).';  W = zeros(N+1, numel(alpha));
W(1,:) = alpha(:).';
for j = 1:N
    k1 = h * f(t(j),        W(j,:)).';
    k2 = h * f(t(j)+h/2,    W(j,:) + 0.5*k1.').';
    k3 = h * f(t(j)+h/2,    W(j,:) + 0.5*k2.').';
    k4 = h * f(t(j)+h,      W(j,:) + k3.').';
    W(j+1,:) = W(j,:) + (k1 + 2*k2 + 2*k3 + k4).'/6;
end
end
</code></pre>

\[ y''=-\frac{2}{x}y'+\frac{2}{x^2}y+\frac{\sin(\ln x)}{x^2},\qquad 1\le x\le2,\quad y(1)=1,\ y(2)=2 . \] <p>精确解</p> \[ y=c_1x+\frac{c_2}{x^2}-\frac{3}{10}\sin(\ln x)-\frac{1}{10}\cos(\ln x), \qquad c_1\approx1.139,\ c_2\approx-0.0392 . \] <p>用 \(N=10\) 的 RK4 打靶，误差量级 \(O(h^4)\)，各节点上与精确解吻合到 \(10^{-6}\) 以内。</p> <pre><code>p = @(x) -2./x;  q = @(x) 2./x.^2;  r = @(x) sin(log(x))./x.^2;
